fcpi patch 0006: reproducible linux/arm64 build (decisions D4 and D6; evidence/M0/INTERPRETATION.md §4)
Upstream 7666c1f9, apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/api/native. Digest-pinned FROM lines, Go 1.27.1, Rust 1.98.1
from a digest-pinned image, a committed Cargo.lock built with --locked, apt from a fixed Debian snapshot, and
the FoundationDB client checked against its published SHA-256.

diff --git a/apps/api/Dockerfile b/apps/api/Dockerfile
